title: "VR-Hands-Interactions-Adapted: experimental data and analysis scripts on hand interactions in adapted virtual environments"
abstract: "Experimental data and Python analysis scripts on hand interactions in adapted and non-adapted virtual reality environments, including difficulty indexing and visualisation of hand movement, from the VR-Shopping case study with users with motor disabilities."
